    {
      "type": "admonition",
      "id": "txt_1779",
      "reading_order": 2071,
      "severity": "caution",
      "content": "CAUTION: Wear heavy work gloves when you handle impellers. The sharp edges can cause physical injury.",
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.0,
        "t": 321.45009,
        "r": 194.52999999999997,
        "b": 310.21009
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1781",
      "reading_order": 2073,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.0,
        "t": 266.7946400000001,
        "r": 236.19999999999993,
        "b": 255.55464000000006
      },
      "content": "Install the impeller."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1782",
      "reading_order": 2074,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 144.0,
        "t": 182.95464000000004,
        "r": 372.3200000000001,
        "b": 171.71464000000003
      },
      "content": "Attach a shaft wrench and a coupling key on the shaft."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1783",
      "reading_order": 2075,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 161.99998,
        "t": 167.95464000000004,
        "r": 552.6799900000005,
        "b": 132.71464000000003
      },
      "content": "When the impeller (101) makes firm contact with the sleeve (126), raise the shaft wrench (counterclockwise, viewed from the impeller end of the shaft) off  of  the bench and slam it down (clockwise, viewed from the impeller end of  shaft)."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_1784",
      "reading_order": 2076,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 161.99988000000002,
        "t": 130.45464000000004,
        "r": 378.37988,
        "b": 119.21464000000003
      },
      "content": "Apply a few sharp raps to tighten the impeller (101)."
    },
    {
      "type": "table",
      "id": "tbl_0070",
      "reading_order": 2077,
      "section": "CAUTION:",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 160.81488037109375,
        "t": 250.67742919921875,
        "r": 558.7214965820312,
        "b": 203.3067626953125
      },
      "markdown": "| Pump size         | Action                                                                    |\n|-------------------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------|\n| STi, MTi, and LTi | Install the impeller (101) with an O-ring (412A).                         |\n| XLT-i and i17     | Install the impeller (101) and a Teflon washer (428D) on the plug (458Y). |",
      "rows": 3,
      "cols": 2
    }
